 ```
 
 No engine, reducer, projection permission, policy, SLA, D fixture, or state model was broadened in fix round 1. No final root capture was modified by the new browser regression; it writes only `audit/reports/readiness-guidance-fix1-results.json`.
+
+## Final review wave — validated basis and freshness
+
+Final review reproduced three S1 presentation contradictions: quarantine after assessment, quarantine after Resume, and an explicit current Unknown assessment. The hero had read the latest assessment's `sufficiency` directly, so it could present stale assessment content as current or send a current Unknown outcome back to assessment.
+
+The bounded correction uses only existing native projections. `g.steps[2].semantics.freshness` makes changed input the first priority, while `projection.predicates.resume` supplies the validated finding/branch/basis relationship independently of role permission. `projection.actions.resume_branch.allowed` remains only the CTA guard. Stale states direct KYC Operations to intake release, evidence linking and reassessment with no primary action. Current Unknown keeps Resume when allowed and otherwise waits for a configured operations reviewer. No engine, guard, state model, policy, permission, owner rule, or business write changed.
+
+### Final-wave RED / GREEN
+
+RED: `node --test prototype/tests/product-experience-guidance.test.mjs` produced `13` tests, `10` pass, `3` fail after the three rendered regressions were added. The failures reproduced both stale hero contradictions and the Unknown path.
+
+Fresh GREEN evidence:
+
+- `node --test prototype/tests/product-experience-guidance.test.mjs` — `13/13` pass.
+- `node --test prototype/tests/*.test.mjs` — `333/333` pass, `0` fail, `0` skipped.
+- `node audit/tests/guidance-final-wave.mjs` — PASS. The live product rendered changed-input guidance with KYC Operations as next actor after Resume then quarantine; session data remained exactly equal through page open/render.
+- `node --check audit/scripts/report.mjs && node --check audit/tests/guidance-final-wave.mjs` — PASS.
+
